    "The panel under the picture is a trackpad: the pointer moves with your finger, taps click where it is. While you move it, a loupe magnifies around the pointer. Pinch the picture to zoom in, double-tap it to fit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The panel under the picture is a trackpad: the pointer moves with your finger, taps click where it is. While you move it, a loupe magnifies around the pointer. Pinch the picture to zoom in, double-tap it to fit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "画面下方的面板是触控板：指针随手指移动，轻点就在指针处点击；移动时，指针周围会出现放大镜。双指捏合画面可放大，轻点两下还原。"
          }
        }
